fixture wall_ledge_grab
doc BUILD.md s5 Wall: "A ledge-grab is automatic within 10 u of a wall's top" (measured from the feet; docs/adr/0008)
room test/well
spawn 790 201
frames 20
input
  0..19 R
end
expect
  # Feet 9 u below the wall's top (192): past the plain 8 u corner lift, but holding toward the
  # wall makes it the 10 u ledge-grab, which lifts the player onto the top at once.
  at 0 event.ledge_grab=1 nudge_y=-9u y=192u state=ground
  never 0..19 state=wall
end
